{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_84_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"一、二十有一年，春，狄侵衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"二、宋人、齊人、楚人盟於鹿上。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"三、夏，大旱。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"旱時，正也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"四、秋，宋公、楚子、陳侯、蔡侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯會於雩，執宋公以伐宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"以，重辭也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"五、冬，公伐邾。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"六、楚人使宜申來獻捷。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"捷，軍得也。其不曰宋捷何也？不與楚捷於宋也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"七、十有二月，癸丑，公會諸侯盟於薄。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_84_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_84","textTraditional":"會者，外為主焉爾，釋宋公。外釋不志，此其志何也？以公之與之盟目之也。不言楚，不與楚專釋也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}